Chapter 3 — Test Commands Guide
1. Enter Big Wave Beach
enter chapter -c 3 -s 1
Expected: Enters chapter selection for Big Wave Beach.
Expected: Starts Big Wave Beach Stage 1 (or plant selection).

2. Water Tiles & Tide Display
show map
Expected: Right columns show ~ (WATER) and L (LOW_COAST). Tide line at bottom shows which columns are flooded.
Tide advance: Wait for a wave to end. The ~ symbols should spread left by 1 column each wave.

3. Lily Pad Stacking
plant lily_pad 7 0
Expected: "Planted Lily Pad at (7, 0)." — Lily Pad goes on WATER tile.
plant peashooter 7 0
Expected: "Planted Peashooter at (7, 0)." — Peashooter stacks on top of Lily Pad.
plant peashooter 8 0
Expected: "Non-aquatic plants need a Lily Pad on water tiles." — Rejected because no Lily Pad.
plant lily_pad 3 0
Expected: "Lily Pad must be planted on water tiles." — Rejected on land.
show tile status 7 0
Expected: Shows type=WATER [Water] | Base: Lily Pad hp=... | Plant: Peashooter hp=...
show map
Expected: Tile (7,0) shows S (Stacked plant on Lily Pad).

4. Rising Tide — Lily Pad Protection
Let the tide advance by completing a wave. Plants on Lily Pad should survive. Non-aquatic plants without Lily Pad should be destroyed.
show tile status 7 0
Expected: After tide advance, if there's a Lily Pad base, the top plant survives. Without Lily Pad, the plant is destroyed.

5. LOW_COAST Spawning
Each time a new wave starts, LOW_COAST tiles should spawn beach zombies.
show map
Expected: After wave advance, zombies (Z) appear on LOW_COAST tiles (L).

6. Snorkel Immunity
plant peashooter 5 0
peashooter should shoot at snorkel zombies...
Expected: Snorkel zombie submerged in water (~) takes no damage from Peashooter (direct shot).
plant cabbage_pult 5 0
Expected: Cabbage-pult (Lobber) can hit submerged Snorkel zombies even on water tiles.

7. Surfer Crush
plant wall_nut 5 0
When a Surfer zombie passes through: Expected: "[Surfer] crushed a plant while surfing!" — Wall-nut is destroyed immediately, Surfer keeps moving.
After losing surfboard: Surfer becomes normal speed and stops to eat.

8. Fisherman Hook
plant peashooter 3 0
Fisherman hooks from right: Expected: "[Fisherman] hooked plant from col 0 to col 1" — Plant moves 1 tile right each hook.
When plant reaches column next to Fisherman: "[Fisherman] yanked and destroyed a plant!"

9. Octopus Immobilize
plant peashooter 5 0
Octopus throws: Expected: "[Octopus] stuck an octopus on plant at (0, 3) — shoot it to free it!"
show tile status 5 0
Expected: Shows Octopus hp=200 (shoot to free plant!)
show map
Expected: Octopus tile shows O.
Shoot with another Peashooter: Each hit reduces octopus HP. When it reaches 0:
Expected: "Octopus destroyed on tile — plant freed!"
The freed plant resumes shooting.

10. Fast Swimmer
On WATER tiles: moves at speed 0.35.
On NORMAL tiles: slows to speed 0.185.
show map
Check zombie positions — Fast Swimmers on water tiles move faster.

11. Complete Verification Commands
show map
Renders:
- ~ WATER, ^ TIDE, L LOW_COAST
- B Lily Pad base, S Stacked plant on Lily Pad
- O Octopus on plant, Z Zombie
show tile status x y
Shows: tile type, base plant, top plant, octopus HP
